    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "c00e79e3-6994-47b8-b6f6-d5e0fc3b5ada",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Carpets and Vodka - I",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL_SMOOTHSNAKE",
        "PublicId": "133428394906",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0dd81be5-208f-48d9-81fa-8439b9dfa095).Image",
        "Description": "You know Munga, despite how much trouble we give Anton, he is a really good assistant. In fact, he has even caught the eye of other people around the world. In particular, a group of Russian spies. We picked up some chatter that they are going to try and kidnap Anton so that they can have their own errand-runner to do their shit for them. You need to stop them. Since Anton&apos;s favorite suit is the The Profligacy Suit (aka the carpet), you should wear it in case something happens to him. Good luck.",
